'''R0-M1''', also known as '''Romi''', or '''Ro''', was an [[astromech droid]] during the [[High Republic Era]] who served [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]] [[Wes Vinik]].<ref name="Heroes and Hotshots" />

{{Droid-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
R0-M1 was mentioned in an article detailing the [[Young Jedi Adventures Season Two|second season]] of the animated series ''[[Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures]]'', which was posted to the [[Disney+]] website on [[June 14]], [[2024]].<ref name="Disney+">{{DisneyPlus|subdomain=press|url=news/disney-plus-star-wars-young-jedi-adventures-coming-to-disney-plus-and-disney-jr-aug-14|text=Season 2 Of Lucasfilm's Original Animated Series "Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures" Coming to Disney+ and Disney Jr. Wednesday, August 14, with New Shorts Arriving on Disney+ And Disney Jr August 2}}</ref>  This droid was designed by [[Chris Blackstock]].<ref name="Blackstock">{{WebCite|url=https://blackstockart.com/young-jedi-adventures|text=Young Jedi Adventures|work=[[Chris Blackstock]]'s [https://blackstockart.com official website]|archivedate=20250531045658}}</ref>

